\" font-weight=\"700\">H</text><circle cx=\"184\" cy=\"81\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"184\" y=\"83.52\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F2A28\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\">H</text><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"131\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#0072B2\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"21\" y=\"134.6\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\">N</text><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"131\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#0072B2\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"39\" y=\"134.6\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\">N</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F2A28\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Before</text></svg><p>Key: blue N, nitrogen atom; white H, hydrogen atom. The gases react completely by N₂(g) + 3H₂(g) → 2NH₃(g).</p>"
